    A dropped object lands perfectly flat

    A flame burns straight and steady, then extinguishes itself

    A spoken word echoes once, cleanly, and stops

    A spell completes without shimmer or residue

Say things like:

    “For the first time since entering the forest, nothing adjusts after you act.”

